{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31578","headline":"送陶少府赴选 · 李羣玉","name":"送陶少府赴选","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶君官兴本萧疎，长傍青山碧水居。\n久向三茅穷艺术，仍传五柳旧琴书。\n迹同飞鸟栖高树，心似闲云在太虚。\n自是葛洪求药价，不关梅福恋簪裾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}